<h4 id="2.5-Splitting-the-Data-into-Training-and-Testing-Sets"><strong>2.5 Splitting the Data into Training and Testing Sets</strong><a class="anchor-link" href="#2.5-Splitting-the-Data-into-Training-and-Testing-Sets">¶</a></h4><p>To train and evaluate the model effectively, we split the dataset into:</p>
