<li>Testing Set (30%): Used to evaluate the model’s performance on unseen data.</li>
</ul>
<p>Splitting ensures that the model generalizes well and is not overfitting to the training data. We use train_test_split from sklearn.model_selection, ensuring stratification to maintain the proportion of classes in both training and testing sets.</p>
<p><strong>Code:</strong></p>
</div>
</div>
