<h4 id="2.6-Feature-Scaling-%E2%80%93-Standardization-using-StandardScaler"><strong>2.6 Feature Scaling – Standardization using StandardScaler</strong><a class="anchor-link" href="#2.6-Feature-Scaling-%E2%80%93-Standardization-using-StandardScaler">¶</a></h4>
</div>
